    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Will you survive the night?</strong></h2>Cropped is a first-person action adventure analogue horror game where you'll be taken on a wild ride to get to safety.<br>It was just supposed to be a trip for a school reunion.. until it quickly devolves..<br><br>Take on the roll of someone there at the wrong place... and the wrong time..<br><br><br><strong>What's on the tape?</strong><br>Fight to get your your partner back - or don't, the choice is up to you!<br><u>Features:</u><br>- Open world exploration<br>- Secrets and lore brining you into the dark wold of CROPPED<br>- horror-survival combat<br>- retro style analogue VHS combat <br>- replayability - did you make the right decision?<br>- Keyboard / Controller support<br>- 6+ Endings!<br><br><strong>A dark mysterious past..</strong><br>What's going on in this farm?  Unravel the mysteries of what took place and do what is needed to survive!",
